30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh no, whole-building lets are risky! If someone drops out late, the rest of us have to pay for them.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It seems the only way the different year-groups actually bond is if they all sleep in the same place.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,Public bookings are a nightmare. A nine-page application that has to be redone for any date shift is too much.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,Eight people to a room with an eleven o'clock curfew? That sounds like a recipe for exhausted members!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Transport is a huge variable. It can take up nearly forty percent of the budget if we go too far.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, if transport is that expensive, maybe staying local is the only way to keep the fee low?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, if the inland centers are too strict, perhaps a more relaxed environment would help everyone relax and talk.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, staying local might help the budget, but we have to consider who is doing the actual work to set it up.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, I just don't want everyone to be grumpy because they didn't sleep!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, yes, the cost difference between local and distant is staggering.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm worried about the ""hidden"" costs. If we use a lodge, the non-refundable deposits are scary.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"If we don't stay together, we might as well not go. The attendance sheets show people are already dropping out.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,Cooking for ourselves is another hidden cost in time. Two hours a day is a lot for the duty pair.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The public beds are cheap, but the sleeping conditions sound terrible. I'm not sure about that.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We cannot afford another budget shortfall. We need a predictable cost structure.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
