55,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is cheap, but Option C's lodge sounds like a financial risk if people cancel.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A doesn't guarantee we'll stay together. Option B and C are better for bonding.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B has that awful application process. Option A is easier, but Option C handles the meals.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option B sounds like a dormitory prison! I'd much rather the Coastal Lodge or just staying on campus.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A minimizes transport costs, which is the biggest risk. But Option C is a fixed quote.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, but if we do Option C and three people quit, the fee goes up for everyone else!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Ryuji, if we want the members to actually mix, we have to get them away from their usual circles.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, I agree, but someone has to do the paperwork. Option A is the least stressful for the staff.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, I don't care about the money as much as the sleep! Option C sounds the most comfortable.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"Option A is the safest for the club account, but it might not be a ""camp"" in the true sense.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm leaning towards Option A. It's the only way to avoid the deposit drama.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I can't support Option A. We need the shared experience of Option B or C to fix the club's atmosphere.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B is out because of the bureaucracy. Between A and C, A is much easier to manage.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for Option C! I want a real bed and a nice view.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we choose Option C, we must be very strict about the headcount. But Option A is the most fiscally responsible.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Mio,,I'll vote for A. Let's keep it simple and cheap.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I'll vote for C. It's the best chance for the members to actually bond.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'm voting A. I won't spend my whole month on a nine-page application or cooking.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Rin,,Option C for me! No dorms!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll vote A. We can't risk the budget again.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
